        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are proud to present this stunning own door, one-bedroom apartment ideally located in this highly sought-after development in Finglas, Dublin 11.\n\nNo. 13 boasts a prime location conveniently located close to Finglas Village and Charlestown Shopping Centre, this superb apartment has a wide array of local amenities close by. IKEA and DCU and Poppintree park are close by, to mention just a few local amenities. There are excellent road networks including the M50 & N2 motorways and to bring you in & around Dublin City along with bus stops right outside your doorstep making 13 Parkview Drive a perfectly positioned home.\n\nBright and airy internal living accommodation of c. 45 sqm comprises entrance hallway, open plan living room/kitchen with access to a large private balcony, utility room, generous double bedroom and a tiled modern bathroom with bath and shower.   No 13 is coming to the market in turn key condition throughout and benefits a private balcony off the living room, recently renovated bathroom and a designated parking space.\n\nAn opportunity not to be missed; Contact the agent at our Northside office on 01-6995050 or 086-0469458 for further information or to arrange viewing!!\n\nAdditional Features:\n\n<ul>\n <li>c. 45 sq.m</li>\n <li>BER C</li>\n <li>Own Door Apartment</li>\n <li>Private balcony</li>\n <li>Light filled interior</li>\n <li>Designated parking space</li>\n <li>Recently renovated bathroom</li>\n <li>Only 10 minutes' drive to Dublin Airport</li>\n <li>Within easy reach of M50 & N2 motorways</li>\n <li>Highly sought-after development</li>\n <li>Bus routes to City Centre outside development</li>\n <li>Management fees 1200 per annum</li>\n <li>Close to Finglas Village & Charlestown Shopping centre</li>\n <li>Ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike</li>\n <li>Early Viewing is highly advised!!</li>\n</ul>"
      },
      {
